 0030   0006    '----- shadow-door watchers (ALL rooms): warning light + pacing
                 silhouette
 0030   0006    '----- per door, gated on the killer-schedule lookahead ("would
                 walking
 0030   0006    '----- through this door kill me"). Data = SHADW2.PAC v6 (up to
                 20 watcher
 0030   0006    '----- instances, each tagged with its ROOM + watched destinati
                on; raw rect
 0030   0006    '----- blocks + 4-phase pre-shifted shadow masks). ShadRoom bui
                lds the
 0030   0006    '----- active set for the current room (<= 4 per room); ShadTic
                k loops it.
 0030   0006    '----- (the pixel pool lives in GAME.BAS far heap -- REDIM SHAR
                ED sdwDat --
 0030   0006    '----- and is passed in ovf()-style; DGROUP only holds the stat
                e below)
 0030   0006    DIM SHARED sdwOn AS INTEGER, sdwHave AS INTEGER, sdwN AS INTEGE
                R, sdwSd AS INTEGER
