 0E8A   0CA4    '----- pause rate2*0.05s between animation frames (TIMER-based,
                 midnight-safe)
 0E8A   0CA4    SUB AnimWait (rate2)
 0E95   0CA4            t! = TIMER
 0E95   0CA4            DO
 0EA6   0CA4                    IF TIMER < t! THEN EXIT SUB
 0EC0   0CA4            LOOP WHILE TIMER < t! + rate2 * .05
 0EC0   0CA4    END SUB
