                he inventory but
 1007   0CA4            '----- still counting as taken, so their pickup spots n
                ever re-arm
 1007   0CA4            cn% = 0
 1007   0CA4            IF r% = 1 THEN ob(18) = 2: ob(28) = 2: ob(22) = 1: cn% 
                = 22
