 11A6   0CA4    '----- keyboard/joystick navigation for the inventory screen. Z
                ones: 0 = item grid,
 11A6   0CA4    '----- 1 = tabs (left pane), 2 = bottom buttons. k$ = U/D/L/R m
                ove, E = activate.
 11A6   0CA4    '----- Grid: left off column 0 -> tabs (active tab first); movi
                ng toward the inactive
 11A6   0CA4    '----- tab ACTIVATES it; down off the grid (or from the tabs) -
                > the buttons.
 11A6   0CA4    '----- Returns the cursor park spot for the focus in mx2%/my2% 
                and act%:
 11A6   0CA4    '----- 1 selection changed | 2 tab switched | 3 focus moved | 4
                 quit | 5 save/load |
